WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.727
Step 1. Open Purchase Deliveries.

1.2
00:00:02.727 --> 00:00:08.732
From Services, open the store location, and under Inventory and External Supply,

1.3
00:00:08.732 --> 00:00:22.137
select Purchase Deliveries.

2.1
00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:28.030
Step 2. Find the delivery. Draft and Pending deliveries are in the Created tab.

2.2
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:31.316
Finished ones are in the Completed tab.

3.1
00:00:31.316 --> 00:00:37.004
Step 3. Open the delivery. Select View Details on its row.

4.1
00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:39.135
Step 4. Read the details.

4.2
00:00:39.135 --> 00:00:45.232
The card shows the store, the supplier, the status, and who created the delivery.

4.3
00:00:45.232 --> 00:00:47.764
The items are listed below.

5.1
00:00:47.764 --> 00:00:54.026
Step 5. Print the delivery. Select Print to open a printable delivery order.

5.2
00:00:54.026 --> 00:00:57.374
Then select Print again to print it.
